          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-base text-slate-700 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Multiple missing teeth making everyday eating slow or uncomfortable.</li>
            <li>Older dentures that have become loose, cracked, or rub against the gums.</li>
            <li>Preference for a gentle, non-surgical tooth replacement option.</li>
            <li>Sunken cheeks or difficulty pronouncing certain words clearly after tooth loss.</li>
          </ul>
