          <ol class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-base text-slate-700 list-decimal pl-5">
            <li><strong>Gum Check &amp; Primary Moulds:</strong> Dr. Shubham Gupta examines your gums and takes soft, comfortable impressions of your upper and lower jaws.</li>
            <li><strong>Precision Jaw Bite Measurement:</strong> We record how your jaws meet naturally and choose a tooth shape and shade suited to your age and face.</li>
            <li><strong>Wax Trial Fitting:</strong> Before final finishing, you try the teeth set in wax to check comfort, smile look, and speech.</li>
            <li><strong>Final Delivery &amp; Adjustments:</strong> After finishing, we ensure smooth borders and schedule any tiny comfort adjustments if needed.</li>
          </ol>
