            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 list-disc pl-5">
              <li>Rinse dentures after every meal and clean gently using a soft denture brush over a folded towel or water bowl.</li>
              <li>Remove dentures at night and store them in a box of clean room-temperature water (never hot water).</li>
              <li>Start with soft foods cut into small bites and chew evenly on both sides while adapting.</li>
            </ul>
